{
  "$about": "Hand-kept, reviewed in PRs. Names agents reach for that do not exist here, and retired names, each with what to use instead. The one retirement list (scripts/lib/retirement.mjs answers retired(name) and allowed(file) from it): components, props, tokens, words, spellings and outside names each with what to use instead, plus the shared places old names may stay (a place may name the kinds it keeps) and the concepts a words, spellings or outside row may point at that are not components, such as Blanket. A component row marked retired is banned by npm run check:ads-language, and inProse also bans it from component doc prose (a rename with no alias), so retiring a component is one row here. Retired token names are the token plan's (scripts/lib/tokens/plan.mjs, ADR-038); the DS facts module lists them beside these rows, and a token row here that covers a retired name may offer only what the plan maps it to (scripts/lib/retired-names.test.mjs). Rendered into the header of agent-views/components/index.md by npm run generate:agent; every target must exist in components.json or tokens.json (scripts/lib/inventions.test.mjs). Retiring a name replaces every use in the same change; this list only stops it coming back (docs/engineering/coding.md § Retiring a name).",
